    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 An unfortunate princess who was turned into a giant toad by the curse of the evil mage Vijay. Princess Molrang was the daughter of the Unification King, Raoul. Her beauty was famed throughout the kingdom. The stories say that the Dark Mage Vijay cursed her because she refused his love. Beast Lv. 3 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Beasts. Critical Damage +7.5% Atk. Spd. +5% Speed +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sword +10% Resistance to Dual Sword +10% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resistance to Dagger -10% Resistance to Dual Dagger -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
